2026-10-20T03:14:52.6162789Z   ok   a sample stamped before the last does not subtract from the on-time
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6162920Z   ok   zero duty is no derate at all
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6163069Z   ok   the derate is 1 - duty x the loss multiplier
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6163264Z   ok   more duty is always a deeper derate, never a shallower one
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6163585Z   ok   and it is bounded below, so a latched flag cannot zero the pump
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6163744Z   ok   a measured bucket derates from its counted duty
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6163975Z   ok   and a measurement is never averaged with an inference of the same thing
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6164124Z   ok   an untouched bucket still derates nothing
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6164441Z   ok   the summary says which estimator a bucket rests on, and how many defrosts were actually witnessed
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6164640Z   ok   a duty outside [0, 1] is refused, not folded into the bucket
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6164901Z   ok   the range guard rejects only OUTSIDE [0, 1] — 0 and 1 still fold
2026-10-20T03:14:52.6165107Z   ok   a pre-v5.3.0 store loads without raising, and says it was upgraded
