2026-10-20T03:14:52.7914741Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7914868Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915105Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915291Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915418Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915518Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915611Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915733Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915857Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7915976Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916101Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916229Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916237Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916339Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916464Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916599Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916709Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916861Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7916983Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917115Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917249Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917390Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917584Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917762Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917828Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7917945Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918107Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918247Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918365Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918490Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918499Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918629Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918785Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7918934Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919055Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919179Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919321Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919533Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919683Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919824Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7919832Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7920017Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7920233Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7920418Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7920655Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7920663Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7920907Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7921147Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7921355Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7921614Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7921835Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922009Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922017Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922237Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922458Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922624Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922775Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922961Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7922970Z 
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7923153Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7923379Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7923496Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7923623Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7923826Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7923968Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7924096Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7924232Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7924435Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7924578Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7924708Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7924908Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7925155Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7925335Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7925533Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7925749Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7925982Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7926188Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7926402Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7926590Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7926762Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7926997Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7927220Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7927467Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7927621Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7927832Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-10-20T03:14:52.7928074Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
